      "message": "Merge refreshed #1136 (issue/543-sinker-undersize @ e9eaf94d) into issue/547-electrode-from-faces\n\nCarries main (with #1131 merged, #544 orbit, #545 side burn) up the\nstack. Keep-both only: module lists in app lib.rs, motion lib.rs,\noperation/mod.rs, mcp/mod.rs and the mcp tools chain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
