      "message": "test(sinker): give the electrode burn fixture main's wear fields\n\nAfter merging main (#1157 wear compensation), SinkerBurnOp carries\nlayer, wear_lost and wear_over; the sinker_electrode test's burn\nfixture sets them to None (no wear compensation), as sinker_undersize\ndoes, so its burn runs main's burn_compensated path unchanged.\n\nRefs #547\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
